<section class="home-hero">
  <h1 class="home-hero__title">The plants API</h1>
  <p class="home-hero__subtitle">Botanical data, open to everyone.</p>
  <p class="home-hero__lead">
    Trefle is an open botanical data source and REST API. It indexes about one
    million plants gathered from institutional sources and completed by hand
    by contributors. It is free for all.
  </p>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a href="<%= explore_path %>" class="button is-primary">Explore the plants</a>
    <a href="https://docs.trefle.io" class="button">Read the documentation</a>
  </div>
</section>
